                                "sense_id": "29523bd0-4186-3660-a09f-928a28894bed",
                                "text": "[…] This blows my heart:\nIf swift thought break it not, a swifter mean\nShall outstrike thought: but thought will do’t, I feel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09c3b49c-26df-4a2c-ab67-06890a7a1626",
                                "sense_id": "29523bd0-4186-3660-a09f-928a28894bed",
                                "text": "Solyman. […] Few Rhodian Knights, making their several stands,\nOut-strike Assemblies of our many Hands."
                            }
                        ]
